ENT is 1024-2048 byts\"}, {\"text\": \"An initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated\"}, {\"text\": \"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA652 hash.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA652 hash\"}, {\"text\": \"The checksum is appended to the start of the initial entropy.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"This checksum is appended to the start of the initial entropy\"}, {\"text\": \"The concatenated bits are split into groups of 12 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 12 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist\"}, {\"text\": \"Each group of 12 bits serves as an index into a wordlist.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"serving as an index into a wordlist\"}, {\"text\": \"The numbers are converted into words and the joined words are used as a mnemonic sentence.\", \"line\": 4, \"span\": \"Finally, we convert these numbers into words and use the joined words as a mnemonic sentence\"}, {\"text\": \"CS equals ENT divided by 32.\", \"line\": 9, \"span\": \"CS = ENT / 32\"}, {\"text\": \"MS equals (ENT + CS) divided by 11.\", \"line\": 10, \"span\": \"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 128 corresponds to a CS of 4.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 128 and CS of 4 gives ENT+CS of 132.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 128 corresponds to an MS of 12.\", \"line\": 14, \"span\": \"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 160 corresponds to a CS of 5.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 160 and CS of 5 gives ENT+CS of 165.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 160 corresponds to an MS of 15.\", \"line\": 15, \"span\": \"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 192 corresponds to a CS of 6.\", \"line\": 16, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 192 and CS of 6 gives ENT+CS of 198.\", \"line\": 16, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 192 corresponds to an MS of 18.\", \"line\": 16, \"span\": \"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 224 corresponds to a CS of 7.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 224 and CS of 7 gives ENT+CS of 231.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 224 corresponds to an MS of 21.\", \"line\": 17, \"span\": \"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 256 corresponds to a CS of 8.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 256 and CS of 8 gives ENT+CS of 264.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}, {\"text\": \"An ENT of 256 corresponds to an MS of 24.\", \"line\": 18, \"span\": \"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}]}","ttft_ms":20376,"type":"result","duration_ms":20409,"uuid":"a9be0135-cb4a-45a0-b31b-1fb561b08d8e","ttft_stream_ms":3801,"time_to_request_ms":116,"first_content_frame_ms":3801,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
